# Local deploy configuration for Totemic Accord.
#
# Copy this file to tools/deploy.local (which is gitignored) and set WOW_DIR to the
# World of Warcraft folder that CONTAINS the _forever_ directory -- not _forever_
# itself, and not Interface/AddOns.
#
# The deploy script writes this file for you the first time it autodetects an
# install, so you usually do not need to create it by hand.
#
# Windows example:
WOW_DIR=D:\World of Warcraft
#
# Linux (Lutris/Wine) example:
# WOW_DIR=/home/you/Games/battlenet/drive_c/Program Files (x86)/World of Warcraft
#
# macOS example:
# WOW_DIR=/Applications/World of Warcraft
